# Deny-list for the analyze_korean_text Gen2 source archive.
# Keep this list in sync with verify_deployed_source.py RUNTIME_FILES. Only
# files that match a pattern below are excluded from the uploaded archive;
# every other file under this directory ships as function source.
#
# WARNING: gcloud SDK 578.0.0 on Windows produced an EMPTY source archive
# (Cloud Build "Total files: 0") from the previous `*` + `!allowlist` style
# .gcloudignore, even though `gcloud meta list-files-for-upload` correctly
# listed the runtime files — that style is unreliable with this SDK/OS
# combination, so this directory uses an explicit denylist instead.
# Exactness is enforced independently by verify_deployed_source.py, which
# compares the real upload manifest against RUNTIME_FILES, not by this
# file's syntax.
.gcloudignore
.gitignore
.env.example
deploy.env.yaml
test_*.py
smoke_test.py
cleanup_translation_cache.py
verify_deployed_source.py
__pycache__/
*.pyc
